WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.863 --> 00:00:07.568
Turn on Bluetooth and tap "Connect".

2
00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:13.771
Choose your laser from the list.

3
00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:19.982
Tap a wall and measure.

4
00:00:20.482 --> 00:00:26.198
The measurement appears on the wall and the app moves to the next one.

5
00:00:26.698 --> 00:00:32.405
No laser? Type the measurement in the field.

6
00:00:32.855 --> 00:00:37.867
In this video the laser is simulated.

